---
import SiteLayout from '@/layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure | FashionPlusBeauty"
  description="Learn how FashionPlusBeauty identifies affiliate links, sponsored content and other commercial relationships."
  canonicalPath="/affiliate-disclosure/"
>
  <section class="static-page-hero" aria-labelledby="affiliate-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Clear and considered</p>
    <h1 id="affiliate-title">Affiliate disclosure.</h1>
    <p>Our relationship with our readers comes first. Here is how we plan to handle shopping links and partnerships.</p>
  </section>
  <div class="prose-page">
    <div class="legal-notice"><strong>Launch note:</strong> the current sample stories do not contain active affiliate links. Add the disclosure wherever an affiliate link or sponsored placement is introduced, and keep this page aligned with the programs you join.</div>
    <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
    <p>FashionPlusBeauty may use affiliate links in future shopping guides and product roundups. If a reader chooses to buy through an affiliate link, the publication may earn a commission at no additional cost to the reader. Affiliate relationships will not change the price a reader pays.</p>
    <p>We intend to identify affiliate links clearly and close to the relevant recommendation. A general disclosure page does not replace a clear notice within a story or next to a link.</p>
    <h2>Sponsored content and advertising</h2>
    <p>Paid partnerships, sponsored stories and display advertising will be identified as such. Sponsored content will be handled separately from independent editorial coverage, and paid relationships will not be presented as an independent review.</p>
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>For questions about a commercial relationship or a particular link, please <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>. This page is a starter disclosure, not legal advice; review and update it for the rules and programs that apply to the publication.</p>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
